OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after body discovered
OL,4,Ain flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after the body
OL,7,Fof another man was found inside a flat
OL,8,Fin the early hours of Saturday.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Llys Watling on
OL,11,FLondon Road in Holyhead, Anglesey, at
OL,12,Fabout 02:40 where the man was
OL,13,Fdiscovered and pronounced dead at the
OL,14,Fscene.
OL,16,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,17,Fwith the incident and remains in
OL,18,Fcustody, but North Wales Police has not
OL,19,Fsaid what he has been arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
