OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after body discovered
OL,4,Ain flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Richard Sidney said: "We
OL,7,Funderstand this incident may cause
OL,8,Fconcern in the local community and I
OL,9,Fwould like to reassure residents that
OL,10,Fthere will be an increased police
OL,11,Fpresence in the area today as officers
OL,12,Fcarry out house-to-house enquiries and
OL,13,Ffurther investigations."
